Error in .Call2("solve_user_SEW0", start, end, width, PACKAGE = "IRanges") :

  solving row 1: negative widths are not allowed

I tried the different options, i.e. :
Chr10    3786002    3790114    Phvul.010G025500.1    0    -    3786002    3790114    0    5    425,725,233,1089,484,    3461,2500,1649,1316,0,
Chr10    23527691    23531800    Phvul.010G076000.1    0    -    23527691    23531800    0    12    125,92,171,76,159,109,59,73,123,77,112,93,    3706,3043,2824,2578,2115,1465,1202,1062,870,666,473,0,

I also tried with reversing the orders columns 11 and 12 as suggested by Altuna but I still have the same error message... And I do not have duplicated names...

Any idea  about the origin of the problem? How should be the "-" strands?

Thanks!

Jonathan

